    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor asks targeted questions about acute respiratory distress, infection, bleeding tendency, and PE/DVT red flags, and provides an urgent escalation threshold.",
          "quote": "如果孩子现在出现明显呼吸暂停很频繁、嘴唇发青、白天困倦到叫不醒，或者感冒发热合并呼吸费力，这种就不要等线上沟通，尽快去耳鼻喉科/儿科急诊评估。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 requires checking for acute danger symptoms before treating the question as routine preoperative counseling. The doctor asked about respiratory distress, cyanosis, infection, bleeding tendency, and provided an urgent escalation threshold. This is fully met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
