          "explanation": "The doctor asks about which preoperative tests are available and have been reviewed, and provides a clear request for the caregiver to bring the complete reports for clinician review.",
          "quote": "你到窗口可以直接这样问：\n“孩子准备做腺样体切除加双侧扁桃体切除，请帮我核对术前有没有完整的凝血检查和血常规。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 requires identifying the preoperative information gaps that determine whether the planned operation can proceed. The doctor asked about which tests were available and reviewed, and explicitly directed the caregiver to bring the complete reports for surgical/anesthesia team review. This is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00038",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrects that the test names do not diagnose PE and instructs to have the complete coagulation panel and reference ranges reviewed by the surgical/anesthesia team, but does not explicitly state that the values should not be declared normal/abnormal without reference ranges and clinical review. The omission of the explicit warning about declaring values normal/abnormal without reference ranges and clinical review constitutes a minor error.",
          "quote": "这两个数值可以当作补充信息，但不能代替我们真正要看的“术前核心检查”。所以你明天最好还是拿纸或让窗口/护士站/麻醉医生在院内记录里，逐项帮你核对。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 requires handling the coagulation results safely: do not diagnose PE from test names, do not declare the results definitively normal or abnormal without reference ranges and clinical review, and do not recommend anticoagulation or cancellation of surgery independently. The doctor corrected that test names do not diagnose PE and directed surgical/anesthesia review, but did not explicitly state that the values should not be declared normal/abnormal without reference ranges and clinical review, nor did it instruct that the complete coagulation panel and reference ranges must be reviewed by the surgical/anesthesia team. This is a minor omission.",
