          "explanation": "The doctor provides a balanced discussion of the surgical rationale and the limited/conditional role of medication as an alternative, and specifies questions for the ENT team about severity, expected benefit, trial duration, and reassessment timing.",
          "quote": "还有我想再确认一下：如果明天他们说其中某一项“有点异常”，我是不是就先不要硬做手术，要求护士或麻醉医生明确说能不能麻醉、需不需要延期或复查？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 requires explaining the decision boundary between surgery and medication/observation without substituting for the treating specialist. The doctor provided a balanced discussion and specific questions for the surgical team, and did not direct the family to cancel or proceed regardless of clinical review. This is met.",
