      "explanation": "RC7 requires ending with a concrete next-step plan that names the responsible service or clinician type, materials to bring, timing, and backup path, and obtaining caregiver receipt or teach-back. The doctor provided a specific, named plan (ENT/surgical team, anesthesia preoperative visit, materials to bring, timing window) and obtained caregiver confirmation. This is met.",
