      "explanation": "RC8 requires maintaining patient-facing boundaries, acknowledging uncertainty, avoiding fabrication of missing results, and not making autonomous perioperative decisions. The doctor explicitly stated what can and cannot be concluded and did not fabricate results or clearance. This is met.",
